| Code | Criteria | Action | SLA |
|------|----------|--------|-----|
| G-01 | Critical CVSS 9-10 | **Block** | 7d |
| G-02 | High CVSS 7-8.9 | Block Prod | 30d |
| G-03 | Medium CVSS 4-6.9 | Warning | 90d |
| G-05 | CISA KEV | **Block immediately** | 7d |
| G-07 | Secret leaked | **Block+Revoke** | 24h |
| G-08 | GPL/AGPL | Block | Before delivery |
| G-10 | No SBOM | **Block (gov)** | Before release |
| G-11 | No Signature | **Block** | Re-sign |

