## Resource Calculation

### 3 Methods
```
A = Peak-Max: MAX(minimum per tool on VM)
B = Weighted-Sum: Σ(minimum_i × weight_i)
C = Resident Floor: Σ idle_ram of 24/7 tools

Result = MAX(A, B, C) + OS_Reserve → round up to Allocation Ladder
```

### Allocation Ladder
- vCPU: 2, 4, 6, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64
- RAM (GB): 2, 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96, 128
- Disk (GB): 20, 40, 60, 80, 100, 150, 200, 300, 500, 750, 1000, 1500, 2000

### OS Reserve: 1 vCPU, 2 GB RAM, 20 GB Disk

### Frequency Classes
| Class | Frequency | Weight |
|-------|-----------|--------|
| Resident | 24/7 | 0.75 |
| Per-Commit | 10-30/day | 0.65 |
| Per-Build | 5-15/day | 0.575 |
| Per-PR | 3-10/day | 0.525 |
| Nightly | 1/day | 0.425 |
| Weekly | 1-2/week | 0.325 |
| On-Demand | <0.1/day | 0.25 |

