## Project Profiles

### Government / CII
- Impact: High | Security: Maximum
- Frameworks: CYBER2562, PDPA2562, MIN2566, MSPR11, WEB2568, OWASP2025
- License: No GPL/AGPL | Log: 90d | Audit: 7+ years
- Deploy: On-premise / Air-gapped
- Cost: 5,250,000 - 17,500,000+ THB/yr

### Enterprise
- Impact: Medium | Security: High
- Frameworks: PDPA2562, OWASP2025, ISO27001, CLOUD2567
- License: Flexible | Log: 90d | Audit: 1 year
- Deploy: Cloud + On-premise Hybrid
- Cost: 1,050,000 - 5,250,000 THB/yr

### Startup / Internal
- Impact: Low | Security: Basic-Medium
- Frameworks: OWASP2025
- License: None | Log: 14-30d
- Deploy: Self-hosted / SaaS
- Cost: 0 - 175,000 THB/yr

### AI/ML Engineering
- Impact: Medium | Security: High (Data + Model)
- Frameworks: PDPA2562, OWASP2025, ISO27001
- Additional: Model Registry, Data Versioning, Drift Detection
- Cost: 1,750,000 - 7,000,000+ THB/yr

