## Agile Team Workflow & Sprint Workloads

### Team Structure
| Role | Count | Responsibility |
|------|-------|---------------|
| Product Owner | 1 | Backlog priority, acceptance |
| Scrum Master | 1 | Facilitate, remove blockers |
| DevOps Engineer | 1-2 | Pipeline, IaC, automation |
| Platform/SRE | 1-2 | Infra, monitoring, reliability |
| Security (DevSecOps) | 1 | Security gates, compliance |
| Developer | 2-5 | Features, tests, code review |
| QA Engineer | 1-2 | Test automation, quality gates |

### Sprint Cadence (2-week)
- Planning: 2-4h | Daily: 15min | Review: 1-2h | Retro: 1-1.5h | Refinement: 1h mid-sprint

### Roadmap (Sprint-based)
```
Phase 1 (Sprint 1-3): Foundation — Git, Pipeline, Container, Registry, Deploy
Phase 2 (Sprint 4-6): Security — SAST, SCA, Container Scan, SBOM, DAST
Phase 3 (Sprint 7-9): Operations — Logging, SIEM, Monitoring, Backup/DR
Phase 4 (Sprint 10-12): Optimization — Blue-Green/Canary, Chaos, Handover
```

### DORA Metrics
| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| Deploy Frequency | ≥ 1/day |
| Lead Time | < 1 day |
| Change Failure Rate | < 15% |
| MTTR | < 1 hour |
| Pipeline Success | > 90% |
| Security Gate Pass | > 85% |
| Test Coverage | > 80% |

### Sprint Allocation
```
Implementation: pipeline 30% | security 25% | infra 20% | monitoring 15% | docs 10%
Steady-state: features 40% | security 20% | tech-debt 15% | bugs 15% | learning 10%
```

### Definition of Done
- Code: reviewed, tests pass (≥80%), SAST clean, no secrets, no Critical CVE
- Pipeline: green end-to-end, deployed to UAT, docs updated, runbook created
- Compliance: rule IDs mapped, audit trail captured, artifacts signed

---

## Cloud Deployment Options

### Managed Services
| Cloud | CI/CD | Registry | K8s | Monitoring | Secrets |
|-------|-------|----------|-----|-----------|---------|
| Azure | Azure DevOps | ACR | AKS | Monitor+LogAnalytics | Key Vault |
| AWS | CodePipeline+Build | ECR | EKS | CloudWatch+Trail | SecretsManager+KMS |
| GCP | Cloud Build | Artifact Registry | GKE | Cloud Operations | Secret Manager+KMS |
| GitHub | Actions | GHCR | — | — | — |

### Cloud vs Self-Hosted
| Criteria | Cloud | Self-Hosted OSS | Self-Hosted Enterprise |
|----------|-------|----------------|----------------------|
| Initial cost | Low | Low | High |
| Long-term cost | Medium-High | Low | High |
| Team needed | 1-2 | 2-4 | 2-3 |
| Compliance | ✓ built-in | Configure yourself | ✓ + support |
| Air-gapped | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ |
| Lock-in | High | None | Medium |

### Hybrid Pattern (recommended for government)
```
Cloud: CI/CD Orchestration + Registry + Monitoring
Hybrid Agent: Build Agent + Security Scanners + Cache (on-prem)
On-Premise: Production + Database + Log Storage (90d) + DR
```

