## Setup in Cursor

1. Place this file as `.cursorrules` in project root
2. Cursor will automatically apply these rules to all AI interactions
3. Use `@codebase` to give full project context
4. Use Composer for multi-file generation
5. Use Cmd+K for quick inline CI/CD questions
